Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:25.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.00,0:02:16.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《铜山毛榉案》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.20,0:02:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么不对头吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.57,0:03:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个为了艺术而热爱艺术的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the man who loves art for its own sake, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.22,0:03:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}常常是从最不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is frequently in its least important{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最为平常的形象中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lowliest manifestations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.21,0:03:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得到最大的乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the keenest pleasure is to be derived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.39,0:03:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么说也没错 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, if you say so, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.38,0:03:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我高兴的观察到 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is pleasant to me to observe, Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.33,0:03:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从你诚诚恳恳地为我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you have so far grasped this truth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.15,0:03:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}案件所作的记录中\N{\fnArial\fs30}that in these little records of our cases{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.71,0:03:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经掌握了真理\N{\fnArial\fs30}which you have been good enough to draw up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且我肯定地讲 你有时还加以润色\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am bound to say, occasionally embellish, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.87,0:03:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你加以突出的并不是那些我曾经\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you have given prominence not so much{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}参与过的著名案件的侦破\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the many cause celebes and sensational trials{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.29,0:03:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和轰动一时的审讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}in which I have figured, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.12,0:03:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是那些本身情景\N{\fnArial\fs30}but rather to those incidents{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.73,0:03:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是平凡琐碎的案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}which have given room for those faculties{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.51,0:03:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但给人发挥逻辑推论才能的余地\N{\fnArial\fs30}of deduction and logical synthesis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这正是我的特殊研究领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I have made my special province.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.75,0:03:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴你这么说 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of you to say so, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.57,0:04:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你确有错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have erred, perhaps…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.29,0:04:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}错就错在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have erred…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总想把每项记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}in attempting to put color and life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都写的生动一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}into each of your statements, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.35,0:04:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不是将你的任务限制\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of confining yourself to placing upon record{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.47,0:04:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在记述事件因果关系的推理上\N{\fnArial\fs30}that severe reasoning from cause to effect{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.75,0:04:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这实际上是事物唯一值得注意的特点\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is really the only notable feature about the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.23,0:04:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你用这个烟斗时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are always in a disputatious mood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总是在争论\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you choose that pipe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这个问题上 我看我对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems to me that I have done you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.79,0:04:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是十分公正的\N{\fnArial\fs30}full justice in the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.56,0:04:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.65,0:04:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是我自私或是自大\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is not selfishness or even conceit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.05,0:04:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我要求公正地对待我的艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I claim full justice for my art, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.86,0:04:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是因为犯罪是常有的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is because crime is common, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逻辑却是难得的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}logic is rare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.55,0:04:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 应该详细记述的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, it is upon logic rather than upon crime{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.20,0:04:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是逻辑而不是罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you should dwell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把本该是讲授的课程\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have degraded what should have been a course{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}降级成了一连串的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}of lectures into a series of tales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.19,0:05:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我的拙文达不到你的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hardly think my poor scribbling deserve that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我的故事终究让你家喻户晓\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have, after all, made your name a household word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.39,0:05:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啐 我亲爱的老伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, pshaw, my dear fellow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.47,0:05:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于公众 不善观察的公众\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do the public, the great unobservant public, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.17,0:05:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们不可能从一个人的牙齿认出他是编织工\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can hardly tell a weaver by his tooth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.94,0:05:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或从一个人的左拇指看出他是排字工\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a compositor by his left thumb, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们会关心分析和推理的细微区别吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}care about the finer shades of analysis and deduction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.43,0:05:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 如果你确实写的太繁琐\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, indeed, if you are trivial, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.24,0:05:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不能责备你 作大案子的时代已经过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot blame you, the days of the great cases are past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个人 或至少是一个罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, or at least criminal man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经没有了过去的冒险和创新精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}has lost all enterprise and originality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, surely not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:05:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的小行业\N{\fnArial\fs30}As to my little practice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}似乎也退化到了处理家庭琐事\N{\fnArial\fs30}it seems to be degenerating into an agency{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}寻找丢失的铅笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}for recovering ost lead pencils{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.59,0:06:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}替寄宿学校的姑娘们出出主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}and giving advice to young ladies from boarding schools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.09,0:06:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear, dear friend, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么能这么说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}how can you say such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.88,0:06:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想 我已经身处事业谷底了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I have touched bottom, finally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.85,0:06:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎么说 这张我今早收到的条子\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, this note I had this morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.83,0:06:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想标志了我的最低点\N{\fnArial\fs30}marks my zero-point, I fancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.81,0:06:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天啊 谁寄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, goodness, who is it from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.67,0:06:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}读一读\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.05,0:06:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear Mr. Holmes:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.54,0:06:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我急切的想找您商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very anxious to consult you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.53,0:06:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于我是否应该接受别人聘请我\N{\fnArial\fs30}as to whether I should or should not accept a situation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.45,0:06:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当家庭女教师的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}which has been offered to me as a governess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明天十点半来拜访你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall call at half-past ten tomorrow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.39,0:06:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不麻烦你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I do not inconvenience you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.59,0:06:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的忠实的维奥莱特·亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours faithfully, Violet Hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.39,0:06:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不得不承认对这信的内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must confess to being somewhat puzzled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有点疑惑 亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the contents of your letter, Miss, uh, Hunter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.96,0:07:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为你咨询的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}since the matter on which you seek advice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.77,0:07:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不在我的工作范畴之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}is somewhat outside my sual field of expertise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am aware of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.15,0:07:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你会原谅我麻烦你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will excuse my troubling you, I am sure, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确定 因为我最近的经历很不寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}since I have recently had a very strange experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.51,0:07:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有父母或任何亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I have no parents or relations of any sort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.49,0:07:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以请教\N{\fnArial\fs30}from whom I could ask advice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.58,0:07:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想也许你会好心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought perhaps you would be kind enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.56,0:07:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我应该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}to tell me what I should do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.96,0:07:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将会高兴地尽力为您服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall be happy to serve you in any way I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.98,0:07:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray, proceed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.49,0:07:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}西郊有一家出名的家教介绍所\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a well-known agency for governesses in the West End{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叫维斯塔维 我最近每周都要到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}called Westaway's, and I have lately been calling there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.93,0:07:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}询问是否有\N{\fnArial\fs30}about once a week in order to see whether{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.06,0:07:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}适合我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything has turned up which might suit me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.64,0:08:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经理是斯托珀小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is managed by Miss Stoper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她坐在自己的办公室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She sits alone in her own office, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.14,0:08:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求职的女性\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the ladies who are seeking employment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.27,0:08:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在接待室等待接见\N{\fnArial\fs30}wait in the anteroom, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.14,0:08:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后挨个进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and are then shown in one by one, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.71,0:08:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她会在记录本上查看\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she consults her ledgers and sees whether{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.73,0:08:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有没有适合求职者的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}she has anything which might suit them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.72,0:08:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格林小姐在我们的登记簿上已经很长时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Green has been on our books for some years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.94,0:08:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有很好的资历\N{\fnArial\fs30}and has excellent references.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上 她的前任雇主\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, were it not for the swift return to Kuala Lampur{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.20,0:08:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对她非常满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}of her present employer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不是急于举家返回库阿拉兰珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}who finds her most satisfactory, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她今天也不会在这里待选\N{\fnArial\fs30}she would not be available today for your consideration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.80,0:08:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 格林小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Miss Green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.20,0:09:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能要求比这更好的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could not ask for anything better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.19,0:09:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好极了 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, capital, capital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splendid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.29,0:09:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐 亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please be seated, Miss Hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.86,0:09:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是来寻找职位的吧 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, then, you are looking for a situation, miss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.05,0:09:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做家庭女教师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a governess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.71,0:09:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.55,0:09:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要求多少薪水？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what salary do you ask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.32,0:09:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以前在斯彭斯芒罗上校那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had four pounds a month in my last place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是每月4英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Colonel Spence Munro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.97,0:09:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他给她的待遇已经很高了 鲁卡斯尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has given her an excellent reference, Mr. Rucastle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问 毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, doubtless, doubtless, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:09:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是每月4英镑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but four pounds a month?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果那太多了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that seems too much…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太多了？不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too much? oh, tut, tut, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么会有人出这么可怜的小数目\N{\fnArial\fs30}how could anyone offer so pitiful a sum to a lady{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给一位如此有吸引力和造诣的女士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with such attraction and accomplishments?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.27,0:10:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的造诣 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My accomplishments, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能不如你所想像的那样深\N{\fnArial\fs30}may be less than you imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.75,0:10:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}懂一点法文 一点德文 音乐 绘画…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little French, a little German, music, drawing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.54,0:10:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啧 啧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, tut, tut, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.37,0:10:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些都不是主要问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is quite beside the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.05,0:10:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关键是你有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is, have you or have you not{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.90,0:10:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}具备一位有教养女士的举止和风度？\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bearing and deportment of a lady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.83,0:10:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}简单地说就是这一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that is it in a nutshell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望自己有 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would hope to have lady like qualities, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.27,0:10:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have not, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就不适合教育一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you are not fitted for the rearing of a child{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家世和才华\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose background and qualities point{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.48,0:10:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直指成功未来的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a brilliant future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倘若你有 为什么竟有人会要求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you have, why, how can any gentleman ask you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.86,0:10:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}屈尊接受少于三位数的薪水？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to condescend to accept anything under three figures?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.97,0:10:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三位数 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three figures, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.37,0:10:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我提供的薪水 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your salary with me, madam, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.56,0:11:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一年一百英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}would commence at a hundred pounds a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.92,0:11:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都不知道说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hardly know what to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这也是我的习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has also been my custom to advance my young ladies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}预付一部分的薪水给我的年轻的小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}a small portion of their salary beforehand, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好让她们应付旅费上的开支\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that they might meet any little expenses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.35,0:11:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并置办一些衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}of their journey and their wardrobe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.65,0:11:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.23,0:11:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可否问问你住在什么地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask where you live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汉普郡 可爱的乡村地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Hampshire, charming rural place, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.65,0:11:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}铜山毛榉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Copper Beeches, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.11,0:11:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离温切斯特只有5英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}five miles on the further side of Winchester.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.10,0:11:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是最可爱的乡村\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it is the most lovely country, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.78,0:11:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的小姐 还有最可爱的老房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}my dear young lady, and the dearest old country house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的职责呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my duties, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.25,0:11:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很想了解一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be glad to know what they would be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.12,0:11:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个孩子 刚刚六岁的小淘气\N{\fnArial\fs30}One child, one dear little romper just six years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.19,0:11:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How charming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.03,0:11:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯托珀小姐 你要是能看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Miss Stoper, if you could only see him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.09,0:11:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他用拖鞋打死蟑螂\N{\fnArial\fs30}killing cockroaches with a slipper, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一眨眼的功夫 三只就报销了\N{\fnArial\fs30}three of them gone before you could wink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.52,0:12:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very clever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.75,0:12:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我唯一的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sole duties, then, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是 照顾一个孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}are to take charge of a single child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.69,0:12:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.09,0:12:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是唯一的 我亲爱的年轻的小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}not sole, my dear young lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.45,0:12:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what else, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.99,0:12:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的责任是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your duty would be, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我肯定你聪明的头脑能意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I am sure your good sense would suggest, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听候我妻子的任何命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}to obey any little commands that my wife might give.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.35,0:12:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说命令？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said commands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}假如有的话 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Provided, of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些命令是一位小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they were such commands as any young lady{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理应遵从的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}might with propriety obey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.36,0:12:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看 没有任何困难吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see no difficulty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}None, whatsoever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.71,0:12:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很乐意能够帮得上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be happy to make myself useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.19,0:12:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说说服装 比如说 我们都是我们喜欢时尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}In dress, for example, we are faddy people, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 时尚癖 但心眼不坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, Miss Hunter, faddy, but kind-hearted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.94,0:12:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倘若我们给你衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you were asked to wear any dress{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.92,0:12:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让你穿的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we might give you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.49,0:13:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不会反对我们小小的怪癖吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would not object to our little whims, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.08,0:13:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么 不会啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, um, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.31,0:13:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叫你坐在这里 坐在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or to sit here, or to sit there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.71,0:13:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会让你不高兴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that would not be offensive to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者你来之前 把头发剪短一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or to cut your hair quite short before you come to us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.70,0:13:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}剪短头发？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut my hair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.79,0:13:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}剪得很短\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite short.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.17,0:13:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想这可能不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am afraid that's quite impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.02,0:13:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕这点很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am afraid it is quite essential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.90,0:13:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我妻子的小小癖好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little fancy of my wife's, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.66,0:13:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人们的癖好 我亲爱的小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ladies' fancies, my dear madam, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.47,0:13:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人们的爱好必须得考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}ladies' fancies must be consulted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.19,0:13:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 你不打算剪掉头发？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you won't cut your hair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.11,0:13:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 先生 实在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, I'm afraid I could not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:14:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 真可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, well, it is a pity, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为其它方面你实在很合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}because in other respects you might have done very nicely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.37,0:14:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然这样 斯托普小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that case, Miss Stoper, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我最好再看几个姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had best inspect some more of your ladies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.80,0:14:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Hunter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.15,0:14:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你愿意将姓名保留在登记簿上吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you desire your name to be kept upon our books?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.70,0:14:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你乐意的话 斯托普小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you please, Miss Stoper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.51,0:14:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实 登记似乎也没有什么用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, really, it seems rather useless, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然你用这种方式拒绝了最优厚的待遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}since you refused the most excellent offer in this fashion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.81,0:14:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们很难再为你寻找\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could hardly expect us to exert ourselves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.46,0:14:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个这样的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find another such opening for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.65,0:14:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 斯托普小姐 但是我的头发…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Miss Stoper, but my hair…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再会 亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day, Miss Hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.97,0:14:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底为什么他会让你剪短头发？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why on earth should he want you to cut your hair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奇怪的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very strange fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:14:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如你所见 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you may observe, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.89,0:14:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的头发很浓密\N{\fnArial\fs30}my hair is somewhat luxuriant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.08,0:15:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有着栗子般特殊的色泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a rather peculiar tint of chestnut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.90,0:15:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}颇为艺术 在我看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And most artistic, if I may so observe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}考虑到这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has been considered so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能这么轻易的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I simply couldn't think of sacrificing it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.39,0:15:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了满足别人就把它牺牲掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}in such an offhand manner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.64,0:15:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕确实是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I should think not, indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时我就是这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, such was my feeling at the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.17,0:15:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二天我开始想\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next day I was inclined to think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自己是不是错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I had made a mistake, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第三天 我肯定自己错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the day after I was sure of it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我收到了这位先生的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I received a letter from the gentleman himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.28,0:15:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把它带来了 这就念给你听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have it here, and I will read it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.08,0:15:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的亨特小姐：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear Miss Hunter:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯托普小姐将你的地址告诉了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Stoper has kindly given me your address, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.38,0:15:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以写信想问一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I write from here to ask{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.96,0:15:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有没有重新考虑自己的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether you have reconsidered your decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们愿意支付每季度30英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are willing to give 30 pounds a quarter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是每年120英镑来补偿你\N{\fnArial\fs30}or 120 pounds a year, so as to recompense you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我们癖好可能带来的小小不便\N{\fnArial\fs30}for any little inconvenience which our fads may cause you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你的头发呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your hair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:15:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他很坚决\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is insistent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「考虑到你的头发 无疑非常遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}As regards your hair, it is no doubt a pity, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.27,0:16:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尤其是在我们短暂的会面中我就不禁赞美\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially as I could not help remarking its beauty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.88,0:16:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你美丽的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}during our short interview.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.07,0:16:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但恐怕我必须坚持这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am afraid I must remain firm upon this point, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.37,0:16:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}惟愿增加的一点薪水\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I only hope that the increased salary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许足以补偿你的损失「\N{\fnArial\fs30}may recompense you for the loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.31,0:16:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.77,0:16:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经决定接受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mind is made up that I will accept the offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而我想 在走这最后一步前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought, however, that before taking the final step, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最好把事情的全部经过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should like to submit the whole matter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.82,0:16:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your consideration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Miss Hunter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.53,0:16:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然你已经决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}as your mind is already made up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.55,0:16:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情就已经解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the matter is settled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.49,0:16:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 如果你发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, if at any time you should find yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.51,0:16:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有任何的疑惑或者遇到危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}in any doubt or danger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.97,0:16:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}危险？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.92,0:16:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你预见到什么危险？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What danger do you foresee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.72,0:16:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果能够确定 那就不叫危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There seems to be a danger, if we could define it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.61,0:16:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但不论什么时候 白天或晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at any time, day or night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.21,0:16:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打一个电报我就来帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}a telegram will bring me down to your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.91,0:16:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then that is enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.91,0:17:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会马上写信回复鲁卡斯尔先生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall write to Mr. Rucastle at once, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.83,0:17:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在可以安心的去汉普郡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go down to Hampshire quite easy in my mind now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.63,0:17:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.97,0:17:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可不会让我的姐妹接受这样的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should allow no sister of mine to accept such a situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.31,0:17:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（杰夫罗·鲁卡斯尔 汉普郡温切斯特附近 铜山毛榉）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.53,0:18:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的仆人 托勒 他喜欢安全一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my man, Toller, he likes to keep it secure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.76,0:18:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你能理解吧 亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you look apprehensive, Miss Hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.78,0:18:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全可以 鲁卡斯尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all, Mr. Rucastle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:18:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.51,0:19:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你肯定是爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be Edward, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.21,0:19:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很期待见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have looked forward to meeting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.98,0:19:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华少爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Edward, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.51,0:19:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你新的家庭教师 亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is your new governess, Miss Hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.79,0:19:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来你给亨特小姐准备了见面礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I see you have a present for Miss Hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.85,0:19:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干得好 好枪法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well done, good shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.42,0:19:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}铜山毛榉？鲁卡斯尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copper Beeches, Mr. Rucastle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.44,0:19:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全死了 亨特小姐 大部分都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All dead, Miss Hunter, mostly dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.81,0:19:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这里 进来 进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are, then, come in, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.93,0:20:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托勒夫人 这位是维奥莱特·亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mrs. Toller, this is Miss Violet Hunter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是爱德华小主人的家教\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is taking up the position of governess to Master Edward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.97,0:20:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好 亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do, Miss Hunter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.20,0:20:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的房间已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your room is all ready for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.08,0:20:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.95,0:20:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在去 托勒 把行李搬过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along now, Toller, fetch the trunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.29,0:20:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨特小姐 等你休息过后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Miss Hunter, after you are refreshed from your journey, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.92,0:20:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我带你去游览铜山毛榉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take you on a tour of The Copper Beeches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.17,0:20:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}房子很大 鲁卡斯尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The premises is certainly extensive, Mr. Rucastle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.44,0:20:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 这么大的房子需要好好防护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, and the extensive premises need protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.78,0:20:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看 是不是很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look in here, isn't he a beauty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别害怕 亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be frightened, Miss Hunter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.43,0:21:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它是卡罗 我的看门犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's only Carlo, my mastiff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.10,0:21:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我称它为我的 但实际上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call him mine, but in fact, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托勒是唯一能驯服它的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toller is the only man that can do anything with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.11,0:21:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他晚上就放它出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lets him loose at night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.39,0:21:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑那些置身它利牙之下的路人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and God help any trespasser he lays his fangs upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.15,0:21:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们每天喂他一次 但喂的不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We feed him once a day, and not too much then, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以他总是很饥饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that he is always keen as mustard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.14,0:21:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for goodness sakes, Miss Hunter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.69,0:21:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚上无故跨过这道门槛的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}under no pretext set foot across this threshold at night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很可能会丧命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's as much as your life is worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.15,0:21:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鲁卡斯尔夫人马上就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Rucastle will be here shortly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.27,0:21:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她会让你知道她有多么高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she will tell you herself how delighted she is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你接受了这个工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are able to accept this situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.59,0:22:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的待遇非常丰厚 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your offer was a most generous one, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.35,0:22:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是 我还是对你们的要求很好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though, well, I am still curious about the conditions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.64,0:22:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说我小小的癖好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My little fads and fancies, you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.04,0:22:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.92,0:22:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're nothing at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.36,0:22:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我妻子特别喜欢一种颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife is very fond of a particular shade{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.21,0:22:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}铁蓝色\N{\fnArial\fs30}of electric blue, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.20,0:22:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她希望你早上能够在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she would like you to wear such a dress indoors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.74,0:22:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}穿这样的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.37,0:22:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我并没有这样的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do not have such a dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.77,0:22:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, but we have one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.98,0:22:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说到坐在这里 那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}As to sitting here or there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.00,0:22:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者用任何方法逗你笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}or amusing yourself in any matter indicated, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.24,0:22:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会让你感到不方便吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, that need cause you no inconvenience, need it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.56,0:22:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.69,0:23:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好 亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do, Miss Hunter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.78,0:23:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉没去迎接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I was not here to greet you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}微有小恙在身\N{\fnArial\fs30}a slight indisposition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.83,0:23:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你现在已经好多了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you are feeling better now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.22,0:23:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好很多了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much better, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.35,0:23:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚才在和亨特女士讲蓝衣服的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just telling Miss Hunter about the blue dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.65,0:23:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我想那衣服你穿肯定很合身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I think it would fit you very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.15,0:24:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在想这案子究竟会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what desperate circumstances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.48,0:24:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在什么样的恐怖环境下引起的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}could occasion such an appeal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.63,0:24:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾想过七种假设\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have devised seven separate explanations, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.86,0:24:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每种都适用于现在我们知道的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}each of which would cover the facts as far as we know them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.64,0:24:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你更倾向于哪种 福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and which one do you favor, Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.64,0:25:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目前为止还没有比较偏好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the moment, I have no favorites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.08,0:25:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}材料 材料 材料 没有粘土我没法做出砖头来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data, data, data, I cannot make bricks without clay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.32,0:25:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能远离贝克街的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's nice to get away from the fogs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.34,0:25:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乌烟瘴气太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Baker Street now and again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.70,0:25:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多么漂亮的小农房啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What delightful little farms these are, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.34,0:25:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不觉得他们清新美丽吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't you agree, aren't they fresh and beautiful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.54,0:25:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.10,0:25:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我性格被诅咒了的一个表现就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is one of the curses of having a mind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.23,0:25:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每件事都要和自己研究的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a turn like mine that I must look at everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.46,0:25:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特殊问题联系起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}with reference to my own special subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.91,0:25:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这不会让风景的美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it doesn't make the scenery{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.09,0:25:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有损一分一毫 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}any less admirable, does it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.55,0:25:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看这些零星散布的农房\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look at these scattered houses, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.26,0:25:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们的秀丽给你留下深刻印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you are impressed by their beauty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.82,0:25:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到它们时 心里涌现的想法是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look at them, and the only thought which comes to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.85,0:25:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总感觉它们非常孤立\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a feeling of their isolation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.45,0:25:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会使可能发生的罪行得不到应有惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and of the impunity with which crime may be committed there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.07,0:25:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good heavens, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.46,0:25:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁会把犯罪和这些可爱的老农房联系起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}who would associate crime with these dear old homesteads?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.80,0:25:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们总使我充满恐怖之感\N{\fnArial\fs30}They always filled me with a certain horror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.14,0:26:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的信条 根据我的经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my belief, Watson, founded upon my experience, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.10,0:26:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伦敦最卑贱 最恶劣的小巷\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the lowest and vilest alleys in London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.74,0:26:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不会发生比这令人愉悦的美丽的乡村里\N{\fnArial\fs30}do not present a more dreadful record of sin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.35,0:26:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更恐怖的犯罪行为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}than does the smiling and beautiful countryside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.55,0:26:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向我们求援的这位小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had this young lady who appeals to us for help{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.57,0:26:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是住在温切斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}gone to live in Winchester, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.17,0:26:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我绝不会为她担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should never have had a fear for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.37,0:26:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但危险在于这五英里之外的农村\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the five miles of country which makes the danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.57,0:26:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这能说明什么 福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can it mean, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.79,0:26:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕没有足够资料 我们还不能下定论\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot theorize without data, I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.18,0:27:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请继续说 亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, continue, Miss Hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.35,0:27:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the first place, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.64,0:27:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总的来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may say that I have met, on the whole, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.51,0:27:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有受到\N{\fnArial\fs30}with no actual ill-treatment from{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.12,0:27:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鲁卡斯尔夫妇的虐待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. and Mrs. Rucastle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.38,0:27:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我很不放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am not easy in my mind about them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.03,0:27:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且也不能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I cannot understand them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.26,0:27:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能理解什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can't you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.76,0:27:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为他们行为的辩解的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reasons for their conduct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.99,0:27:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我到铜山毛榉后 头两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}For two days after my arrival at the Copper Beeches, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.74,0:27:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生活很平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}my life was very quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.31,0:27:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第三天 我吃过早饭下楼到绘画室\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the third, I went downstairs after breakfast to find{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.52,0:27:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去找鲁卡斯尔夫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. and Mrs. Rucastle in the drawing room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.61,0:27:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鲁卡斯尔先生提到了那件衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Rucastle informed me that a dress, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.09,0:27:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把一件铁蓝色的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}an electric blue dress, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.32,0:27:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放在了我的卧室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}had been laid out for me in my bedroom, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.30,0:27:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要求我穿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and asked me to put it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.56,0:27:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我照他说的做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did as he requested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.29,0:28:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太棒了 亨特小姐 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, superb, Miss Hunter, oh, quite superb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.51,0:28:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不觉得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you not agree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.00,0:28:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再合身不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could not be a better fit, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.16,0:28:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像特地量身制作的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}not if you had been measured for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.39,0:28:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐下 亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, be so good as to sit down, Miss Hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.44,0:28:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完美 太好了 真完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, perfect, I mean, it's quite, quite perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.29,0:28:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐这里 如果不介意的话 亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here, if you don't mind, Miss Hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.90,0:28:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看啊 看啊 多么漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, there, there now, excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.24,0:28:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得舒适吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you quite comfortable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.63,0:28:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.73,0:28:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你希望我在这里坐多久 先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do you wish me to remain here, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.48,0:29:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个小时 可能更久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, an hour, perhaps, perhaps longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.76,0:29:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个小时？\N{\fnArial\fs30}An hour?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.15,0:29:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 我保证绝对不会是无聊的一个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but not, I assure you, an hour of tedium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.13,0:29:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们试试逗你开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us see how we can best entertain and divert you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.68,0:29:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喜欢好玩的故事吗 亨特小姐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you enjoy funny stories, Miss Hunter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.85,0:29:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.45,0:29:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 那我就给你说几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, I shall tell you some, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.22,0:29:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我保证这都是真事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all of them, I assure you, absolutely true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.82,0:29:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我给你讲讲乔治的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you about George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.94,0:29:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他这个人极其特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the most extraordinary character.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.36,0:29:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it seems, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.40,0:29:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人想去温切斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}somebody wanted to find his way to Winchester, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.47,0:29:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后乔治 真是个怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and George, he really is such an eccentric, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.49,0:29:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可能会把他错当成稻草人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might mistake him for a scarecrow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.57,0:29:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说 他的腿总是劈开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, his legs are all astray, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.45,0:29:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的胳膊总是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}his arms always thrust out like this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.06,0:29:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的头活像一个大头菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}his head shaved like a turnip, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.08,0:29:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他头上还带着与众不同的帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and on his head he wore the most extraordinary hat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.15,0:29:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后 鲁卡斯尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Mr. Rucastle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.07,0:29:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在房间的另一边上蹿下跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}walking up and down on the other side of the room, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.47,0:29:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开始讲述我听过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}began to tell me a series of the funniest stories{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.22,0:29:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最好笑的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've ever listened to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.00,0:30:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们想不出他有多滑稽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot imagine how comical he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.44,0:30:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都笑累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I laughed till I was quite weary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.71,0:30:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两天以后完全相同的情景\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days later this same performance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.04,0:30:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又上演了一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}was gone through again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.70,0:30:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是上帝的和平 没人能够理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the peace of God, that passes all understanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.19,0:30:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的天哪 已经一个小时了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, bless my soul, is that the hour already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.46,0:30:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}时间过的真快 太有趣了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time has passed very quickly, and most amusingly, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.04,0:30:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴你这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm glad to hear you say so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.30,0:30:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在该去干自己的工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now, it is time for you to attend to your duties, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.26,0:30:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去换掉衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}so go and change your dress, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.82,0:30:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后去照顾小爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then look to little Edward in the nursery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.74,0:30:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不难想象 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can easily imagine, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.83,0:30:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是多么难以理解这种\N{\fnArial\fs30}how curious I became as to what the meaning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.33,0:30:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}异乎寻常的表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}of this extraordinary performance could be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.09,0:30:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我察觉到他们总是小心的让我脸背对窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since my face was always turned away from the window, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.30,0:30:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我开始好奇想看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I became consumed with the desire to see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.84,0:31:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}背后到底有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}what was going on behind my back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.45,0:31:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一次的表演中\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the very next occasion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.96,0:31:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想办法在手里握了一块镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I managed to conceal a small piece of mirror in my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.90,0:31:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 乔治 我不能告诉你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, George, I can't tell you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.86,0:31:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我笑的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the midst of my laughter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.26,0:31:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将手帕举到了眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I raised my handkerchief to my eyes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.38,0:31:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稍微摆弄了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and was able with a little management{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.78,0:31:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看我背后有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see all there was behind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.29,0:31:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nothing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.31,0:31:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少我第一印象如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least that was my first impression.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.63,0:31:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二次看的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}At second glance, however, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.34,0:31:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我察觉到有一个长胡子的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I perceived that there was a bearded man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.53,0:31:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}靠在场地的围栏上\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaning against the railings which bordered our field, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.93,0:31:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}认真的朝这边张望\N{\fnArial\fs30}and was looking up earnestly at the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.68,0:31:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把举着的手帕放低 瞥了鲁卡斯尔夫人一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lowered my handkerchief and glanced at Mrs. Rucastle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.06,0:31:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发现她正犀利的盯着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find her eyes fixed upon me in a most searching gaze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.53,0:31:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她没说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said nothing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.40,0:32:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我相信她已经猜出我手中有镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm convinced she divined I had a mirror in my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.24,0:32:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰夫罗 那边有个不三不四的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jephro, there is an impertinent fellow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.45,0:32:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}盯着亨特小姐呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}who stares up at Miss Hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.60,0:32:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, does he indeed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.69,0:32:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是你的朋友吧？亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}No friend of yours, Miss Hunter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.29,0:32:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是 我在这里一个人也不认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I know no one in these parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.52,0:32:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 真是不礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear me, how very impertinent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.40,0:32:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不可容忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite intolerable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.18,0:32:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请你转过身去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kindly turn around, Miss Hunter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.30,0:32:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}示意他离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and motion him to go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.18,0:32:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然还是不理他更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely it would be better if we took no notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.66,0:32:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么 让他一直这样看下去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, and have him loitering here always?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.74,0:32:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 转过去 亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, turn around, Miss Hunter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.79,0:32:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像这样挥手让他离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wave him away like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.96,0:32:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是一周之前的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a week ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.57,0:33:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后我就不再坐到窗户边\N{\fnArial\fs30}and from that time I have not sat in the window, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.01,0:33:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也没穿过蓝衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor have I worn the blue dress, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.41,0:33:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更没见过那个长胡子的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor seen the man with the beard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.16,0:33:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 发生了别的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}But something else occurred, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.08,0:33:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让你最终急匆匆来找我的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}an event which caused you to summon me with such urgency?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.71,0:33:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 是的 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, oh, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.21,0:33:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从没有这么害怕过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been so frightened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.93,0:33:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要害怕 亨特小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not distress yourself, Miss Hunter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.16,0:33:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打起精神来 告诉我们是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}compose yourself, and then tell us what it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.00,0:33:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}房子边上有个塔楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a turret to the house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.81,0:33:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来根本没人住在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}which appears not to be inhabited at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.57,0:33:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一扇朝向那边通往托勒家的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}A door which faces that which leads into the quarters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.05,0:33:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以从那扇门进入那间塔楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Tollers opens into the turret, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.07,0:33:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但它通常是锁着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it is invariably locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.75,0:33:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到昨天我才有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was only yesterday that the chance came{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.29,0:34:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走过那扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}for me to pass beyond the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.15,0:34:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托勒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toller?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.44,0:34:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.55,0:36:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原来确实是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it was you, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.36,0:36:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到门开着的时候就想到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it must be when I saw the door open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.49,0:36:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so frightened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.20,0:36:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my dear young lady, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.27,0:36:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么吓着了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, my dear young lady, what has frightened you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.00,0:36:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的年轻小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}my dear young lady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.19,0:36:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我太愚蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…I was foolish enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.40,0:36:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跑到了锁着的塔楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}to go up into the shuttered turret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.01,0:36:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你注意到是锁着的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You noticed it was shuttered then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.77,0:36:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.90,0:36:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照相也是我的爱好之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Photography is one of my hobbies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.07,0:36:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把那间房子作为黑室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have made my dark room up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.92,0:36:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多么循规蹈矩的年轻小姐啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What an observant young lady one has come upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.09,0:37:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里面的光线很昏暗 非常阴森恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was so lonely and eerie in this dim light{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.26,0:37:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很害怕 于是跑了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I was frightened and ran out again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.27,0:37:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}心里还是很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so dreadfully still in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.17,0:37:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是这些？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.30,0:37:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了？你认为还有什么原因？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, yes, what do you think, what other reason?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.49,0:37:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得我为什么要锁上门？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I keep that door locked?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.73,0:37:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确实不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.81,0:37:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了不让无关的人进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is to keep people out who have no business there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.25,0:37:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.08,0:37:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是我早知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure if I had known{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.44,0:37:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你现在知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.05,0:37:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你再敢踏上那台阶\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you ever set foot across that threshold again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.95,0:37:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就把你扔给看门犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll throw you to the mastiff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.50,0:38:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我太害怕了不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so terrified that I didn't know what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.47,0:38:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我想到了你 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I thought of you, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.89,0:38:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我今早从那里轻易脱身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no difficulty in getting leave to come{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.74,0:38:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来到温切斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Winchester this morning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.20,0:38:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我必须在3点之前回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I must be back by 3:00 o'clock, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.60,0:38:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为鲁卡斯尔夫妇要去别人家拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Mr. and Mrs. Rucastle are going on a visit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.31,0:38:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以整夜都不回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will be away all evening, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.09,0:38:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得照顾孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that I must look after the child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.16,0:38:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把我的奇遇都告诉给你了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I've told you all of my adventures, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.27,0:38:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底是怎么回事 我该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it mean, and what should I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.42,0:38:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个少有言语的孩子爱德华有朋友吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does the unspeakable child Edward have a friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.38,0:38:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, uh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.98,0:38:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}农场里一个同样可怕的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}an equally unpleasant child at one of the farm cottages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.53,0:38:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splendid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.45,0:38:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生和我会在4点半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Watson and I will arrive at the Copper Beeches{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.10,0:38:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准时到达铜山毛榉\N{\fnArial\fs30}at 4:30 precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.35,0:38:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但在我们到达之前 有一两件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But before then, there are one or two things{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.95,0:38:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望你去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should like you to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.57,0:39:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我不是认为你一位卓越的女性\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not ask this of you, Miss Hunter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.70,0:39:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是不会让你做这些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I did not think you were quite an exceptional woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.28,0:40:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托勒太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Toller?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.07,0:41:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托勒太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Toller?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.78,0:41:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托勒太太 爱德华可能把自己锁在了地下室了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Toller, I think Edward has locked himself in the cellar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.99,0:41:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地下室？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cellar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.93,0:41:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我哪里都找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can't find him anywhere, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.38,0:41:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经过了喝茶的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it is past his tea time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.26,0:41:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也发现了 我不明白为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just the same, I don't see why Master Edward{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.24,0:41:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华少爷要把自己关在地下室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}would have locked himself in the cellar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.91,0:41:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早些时候门是开着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the door was open earlier, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.27,0:41:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看见托勒拿着一个瓶子出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw Toller come out with a bottle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.99,0:41:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能他去找蟑螂了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps he went down to look for cockroaches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.73,0:41:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}门锁着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.23,0:42:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打开了 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.52,0:42:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您先请\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.70,0:42:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our destination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.89,0:42:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你确定看门犬没有被放出来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, can we be quite sure the mastiff isn't loose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.27,0:42:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到达房子之前什么也不能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can be sure of nothing until we reach the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.16,0:43:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good God, what was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.46,0:43:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.50,0:43:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}往左走 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the left, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.30,0:44:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里肯定有发生过恐怖的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has been some villainy here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.84,0:44:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来有人从房顶上爬过来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks as though someone has gone across the roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.34,0:44:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱丽丝 爱丽丝…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, Alice, Alice, Alice, Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.33,0:44:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱丽丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.22,0:44:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我女儿呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is my daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.29,0:44:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还要问你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is for me to ask you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.07,0:44:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他女儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}His daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.39,0:44:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贼 你们这些间谍 贼间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thieves, you spies, thieves and spies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.33,0:44:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我抓到你了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have caught you, have I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.31,0:44:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在我手心里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have you in my power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.98,0:45:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来好好伺候你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll serve you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.42,0:45:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.13,0:45:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他去放狗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone for the dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.77,0:45:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.90,0:45:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人放了狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone has loosed the dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.98,0:45:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它已经两天没有喂食了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not been fed for two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.86,0:45:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点 不然就迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick, before it's too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.81,0:46:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还昏迷着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still unconscious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.79,0:46:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done what I can for him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.08,0:46:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他需要立刻进行手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}he now needs a surgeon as soon as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.06,0:46:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经派托勒叫鲁卡瑟尔夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've dispatched Toller to Mrs. Rucastle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.93,0:46:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去找医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}to summon such assistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.50,0:46:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小姐 可惜你不曾让我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, miss, it's a pity you didn't let me know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.96,0:46:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you were planning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.21,0:46:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我本来早点可以告诉你 省得你费那么大的劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have told you your pains were wasted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.09,0:46:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很明显 托勒太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's clear Mrs. Toller knows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.38,0:46:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比谁都了解这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}more of this matter than anyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.36,0:47:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生 我知道 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yes, sir, I do, and I'm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.01,0:47:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经准备好把我知道的一切告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready enough to tell you what I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.41,0:47:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是如果警察要介入这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if there's police court business over this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.33,0:47:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}记住我是爱丽丝小姐的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will remember I was Miss Alice's friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.82,0:47:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱丽丝小姐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Alice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.74,0:47:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鲁卡斯尔先生第一次结婚时的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Rucastle's daughter by his first marriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.12,0:47:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是锁着的塔楼的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, the mystery of the shuttered turret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.60,0:47:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托勒太太 请坐下说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Toller, please sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.98,0:47:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我你知道的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, tell me all you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.52,0:47:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她在家里从来没有开心过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she was never happy at home, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.96,0:47:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱丽丝小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Alice wasn't, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.74,0:47:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从他父亲再次结婚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the time that her father married again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.45,0:47:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她… 她开始有点冷漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}She… she was slighted like, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.58,0:47:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么话也不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and had no say in anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.81,0:47:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是… 事情开始好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… but it didn't became bad for her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.42,0:47:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当她遇到了富勒先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}until after she met Mr. Fowler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.44,0:47:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请问 谁是富勒先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And pray, who is Mr. Fowler?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.61,0:47:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是爱丽丝小姐年轻的男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he was Miss Alice's young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.41,0:48:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你… 你可能看到过他在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… you might have seen him hanging about, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.68,0:48:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}场地边的路上转悠\N{\fnArial\fs30}out in the road by the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.07,0:48:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.44,0:48:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}富勒先生的卷入\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how did Mr. Fowler's involvement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.24,0:48:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又给绝望的爱丽丝带来了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}bring Miss Alice to her distressing circumstances?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.27,0:48:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, as far as I could learn, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.71,0:48:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱丽丝小姐有母亲遗嘱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Alice had rights of her own{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.67,0:48:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赋予的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}under her late mother's will, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.93,0:48:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她是如此安静和忍让\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she was so quiet and patient, she was, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.15,0:48:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从来不提权利的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}she never said a word about them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.82,0:48:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是将一切都交给鲁卡斯尔先生处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}but just left everything in Mr. Rucastle's hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.75,0:48:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他知道和她在一起可以很放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he knew he was safe with her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.24,0:48:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但一旦有丈夫掺和进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but when there was a chance of a husband coming forward, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.48,0:48:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一定会要求在法律范围内应得的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}who would ask for all the law will give him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.71,0:48:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于是她父亲认为是该制止这事的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, then, her father thought it time to put a stop on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.20,0:48:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他要女儿签署一个字据\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted her to sign a paper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.22,0:48:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}声明不管她结婚与否\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that whether she married or not, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.34,0:48:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他都可以用她的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}he could use her money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.71,0:48:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于她不愿意签\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when she wouldn't do it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.66,0:48:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就一直闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}he kept worrying her, worrying her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.21,0:49:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到女儿得了脑炎\N{\fnArial\fs30}till she got brain-fever, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.30,0:49:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}徘徊在死亡的边缘六个星期之久\N{\fnArial\fs30}for six weeks she was at death's door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.05,0:49:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后她逐渐康复\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she got better at last, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.08,0:49:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但已经骨瘦如柴\N{\fnArial\fs30}all worn to a shadow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.99,0:49:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美丽的头发也剪掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with her beautiful hair cut off, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.60,0:49:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他把她安排到塔楼去住\N{\fnArial\fs30}he moved her to the turret room, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.56,0:49:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把她囚禁在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}where she was kept prisoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.00,0:49:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这不能让她的男朋友变心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that didn't make no change in her young man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.92,0:49:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他仍然对她十二分的忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he stuck to her true as a man could be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.19,0:49:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后鲁卡斯尔先生把亨特小姐从伦敦带过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then Mr. Rucastle brought Miss Hunter down from London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.05,0:49:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来假扮她的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}in order to impersonate his daughter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.62,0:49:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样来摆脱那个年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get rid of the young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.81,0:49:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是这样的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was it, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.21,0:49:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是富勒先生是一位坚持不懈的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Mr. Fowler being a… a persevering gentleman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.69,0:50:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就好像一名好水兵一样 封锁了房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a good sailor should be, blockaded the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.32,0:50:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后来遇见了你以后 通过各种手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}And having met you succeeded by certain arguments, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.21,0:50:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}金钱还有其他方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}metallic and otherwise, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.26,0:50:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说服了你 使你相信你和他的利益是一致的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in convincing you that your interests were the same as his?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.12,0:50:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}富勒先生是一位和蔼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fowler was a very kind-spoken, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.40,0:50:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出手阔绰的先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}free-handed, gentleman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.63,0:50:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通过这种手段 他设法让你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in this way he managed that your husband{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.48,0:50:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他设法让你的丈夫不缺酒喝 没锁好门\N{\fnArial\fs30}should not want for drink, the gates unlocked, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.71,0:50:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确保猛犬被栓好\N{\fnArial\fs30}thus insuring that the mastiff should remain chained, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.11,0:50:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把一把扶梯准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that a ladder should be ready to assist him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.40,0:50:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帮助他把爱丽丝小姐救出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the rescue of Miss Alice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.97,0:50:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如你所说 就是这么一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have it, sir, just as it happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.34,0:50:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于是铜山毛榉那所邪恶房子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thus was solved the mystery of the sinister house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.44,0:50:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谜团解开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}called The Copper Beeches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.01,0:50:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鲁卡斯尔先生幸免于死 但已经精神颓废\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Rucastle survived, but was always a broken man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.81,0:51:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全凭他忠心耿耿的妻子护理才苟延残喘\N{\fnArial\fs30}kept solely alive through the care of his devoted wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.56,0:51:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还和他们的老佣人住在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}They still live with their servants, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.16,0:51:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概他们知道鲁卡斯尔家过去的事太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}who probably know so much of Rucastle's past{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.67,0:51:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鲁卡斯尔先生很难辞退他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he finds it difficult to part from them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.68,0:51:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}富勒先生和鲁卡斯尔小姐申请特许证书结了婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fowler and Miss Rucastle were married by special license{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.72,0:51:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他现在任职于\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he now holds a government position{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.85,0:51:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毛里求斯岛的政府中\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the island of Mauritius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.83,0:51:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨特女士现在担任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Hunter is now head of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.17,0:51:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔索尔地区一家私立学校的校长\N{\fnArial\fs30}a private school in Walsall, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.54,0:51:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信她在教育工作上颇有成绩\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I gather she has met with considerable success.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.66,0:51:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 福尔摩斯 你的意见呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, Holmes, your verdict?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.44,0:51:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常美好 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}An admirable account, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.09,0:51:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不认为我加入了太多色彩和活力吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you don't think I've put too much color and life into it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.03,0:52:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my dear friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.33,0:52:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我卑谦的顺从\N{\fnArial\fs30}I humbly defer such considerations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.97,0:52:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你漂亮的叙述\N{\fnArial\fs30}to your excellent literature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.30,0:52:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
